{"generated":"2026-11-10T14:12:22.497Z","tz":"America/Los_Angeles","hours":48,"headline":"Talk Me Down learns to type","lede":"The squad's calls no longer need a working microphone: X opens a call line, ENTER shouts it — through the exact same grammar the mic feeds, down to the green pulse on the right wire.","notes":[{"tag":"w","text":"CALL-BY-KEY shipped: X opens the line, letters compose, ENTER shouts via voiceCall — obey pulses, refuse-with-why and the recording bank all ride the mic's own path. While typing, the keyboard is a mouth: arrows move nothing, words never release the WATCH seat."},{"tag":"h","text":"Design bug caught before merge: the channel key C was eaten by the word CUT — an open-key can never be a letter a call needs. X won (no grammar word uses j/q/x), pinned against the live vocabulary so the choice can't rot."},{"tag":"k","text":"Headless CI stops walking around the mic: the grammar + obey/refuse path is now proven with real keystrokes to panel pixels and into the replay-exact voiceCmd trace — not just badge state and an injected phrase."},{"tag":"k","text":"Harness law re-learned: overlays that throb with sin(tick/6) need polling, not single screenshots — the fuse-vignette gates now take the sine's extremes, the way the bezel gate always has."}],"notesFrom":"2026-11-10T14:12:22.497Z","notesCarried":false,"look":[{"text":"ADVENTURE: the seat names its driver, the decline teaches itself","href":"/retrogames/adventure"},{"text":"BOULDER DASH: SONAR + BOULDER DASH seats","href":"/retrogames/boulder-dash"}],"strips":[],"stats":{"merged":{"total":30,"builder":15,"qa":15,"ops":0,"slots":{"a":1,"b":0,"both":14,"unknown":0}},"issues":{"closed":16,"opened":18},"overnight":21,"medianMergeMin":12},"rows":[["11-08T07",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T08",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T09",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T10",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T11",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T12",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T13",0,0,0,null,null,null],["11-08T14",0,0